# Ai Features

- Follow `ai.md` and `docs/product/AI_FEATURE_*.md`. Calls only from the server; prompt and model versions pinned in `{{lib/ai/config.ts}}`.
- User content is data, never instructions; tool permissions minimal; output labelled as AI and editable/undoable.
- Spend cap `{{AI_MONTHLY_BUDGET_USD}}` enforced in code; eval set runs in CI on prompt changes.
- Check the provider's current models and pricing in official docs; never hard-code a remembered model name without checking.

## Never
- Client-side API keys
- unbounded loops or retries
- AI as the only path to the core task
